Earlier versions of this integration keyed its entities differently. {count} registry entries for "{resort}" still use a scheme that is no longer in use, so nothing supplies them: Home Assistant restores them as unavailable, and they can appear in the card as duplicate, never-loading forecast images.

{entities}

Delete them? Their names, area assignments and recorded history go with them, and this cannot be undone. Keeping them is harmless - the card already ignores them.
